Output assets/demo-server.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 740
Set Height 380
Set Padding 8
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 0
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 28
Set CursorBlink false
Set Framerate 30

Hide
Type "PS1='' && clear && bash ./assets/demo-server.sh"
Enter
Show
Sleep 30s
